WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask this -- You wer
in a film, "Doctor Sleep,"

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:04.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
which was an incredible sequel
to "The Shining."

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:07.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a story about a man
haunted by ghosts.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I am very skeptical of ghosts

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I do like asking guest
on the show.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.579 line:92%
You have had an encounter.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.516
-I had one. It's a sort of lon
story that I'll try and shorten.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when I was --
It was my 20th birthday.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was at drama school
in London.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:25.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was at Easter. And
Passover happened to be aligne

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.727 line:92%
the same weekend, same day

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.628 line:92%
And in the morning, my --

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.096 size:84% position:42%
It was a student house.
And no one was there

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:33.133
'cause everyone had gone awa
for the holidays, except me.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:33.833 line:92%
And I watched this movie.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.369
I stole someone's video recorder
from their room

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
to watch "Blue Velvet."
-Yeah.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And after I had watched
"Blue Velvet,"

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.841 line:92%
I was standing, running a bath

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
leaning in the doorway
in a robe.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was at
the top of the house.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.580
My bedroom was at the top
of a staircase on its own.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.683
And then there was a dark corr--
hallway with other bedrooms,

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then downstairs,
a bigger flat downstairs -

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Apartment. Sorry.

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.257 line:92%
Now I'm an American. Apartment

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:57.791 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:01.694
And I was suddenly struck
with this pain on my back.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.530 line:92%
And I ripped off my robe.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:08.068
And there was a big, black bur
mark on the back of my robe.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.335 line:92%
And I ran around, thinking

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe when I got the video out
or something,

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:14.274
maybe there was a spark
or a fire or something happened.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.142 size:75% position:38%
-That's why we don't
have VCRs anymore.

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.143 line:92%
-No, exactly. So I ran around,

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.412
thinking maybe I had caught fire
on something.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.748
Nothing. Couldn't find anything.
I looked at the robe again

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I see the whole back o
the robe was singed dark brown

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:28.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then this black burn mar
on my shoulder blade.

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:30.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I freaked out,
and I got out of there,

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:33.126
and I went and spent my birthday
with my uncle Dennis.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:33.960 line:92%
And the next day, I came back,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the guy who owned the
apartment downstairs was back.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:38.731 line:92%
And I suddenly went, "Oh, yeah

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
this odd thing happened
the other night."

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.536 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And his face went ashen.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:44.237 line:92%
And I said, "What is it?"

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "No,
I don't want to tell you."

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:46.840 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I said, "What is it?"

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "Look, the guy
who owned my flat downstairs

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:53.880 line:92%
was an old, reclusive guy,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.748 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and he never went out.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:58.451
He used to walk to the hedge and
sit at the hedge and go back in.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.587
And his brother would come
'round two or three times a week

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:02.822
and give him a hot meal.
Otherwise, he didn't really eat.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, his brother got sick
one week, didn't come,

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:10.063
and the gentleman was
boiling a kettle in his kitchen.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:12.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was so hungry
that he fainted,

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
the kettle set fire
to his kitchen,

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:18.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was burned on his back,
dragged out of the house,

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:22.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he died of his burns
to his back."

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.244 line:92%
And I was like, "Oh, my God.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:24.777 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, listen, you've got -
I thought he was --

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:29.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were actors, right? So
I thought, "He's making it up.

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So he phoned up the landlady.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
She told the story
so I could hear it.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:35.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
She said, "But he was
a very nice man.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.890 size:75% position:38%
I'm sure he wouldn't
wish you any harm."

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, she was like,
"He wouldn't be haunting you."

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He wouldn't be doing
anything nasty like that.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was very clear
on the lease, "No haunting."

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"No burning."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.232 line:92%
So, we went -- So I freaked out.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "I'm not
sleeping up there.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not sleeping in my room,
because I freaked out.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.838 line:92%
So we went down to his bedroom

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:52.839 line:92%
I brought my bedding down.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.374 size:81% position:41%
And as we were walking
into his living room,

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:57.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Look, I don't know --
I'll use the man's --

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:00.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
Say it was Mr. Goldblum,
for instance.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-I said, "Look --"

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was dirty.
We were drama students.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:07.587
We didn't do much cleaning
I said, "It's as dirty as --

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:11.357
It's as dusty as when
Mr. Goldblum used to live here."

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I put my bedding
in the corner.

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I looked up,
and my friend was over there

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:18.231
And as I looked up,
the ceiling fell down like this.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:21.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
The whole ceiling came down,
like, in a wave.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.936 line:92%
And there was this scream like

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:25.271 size:88% position:44% line:92%
[High-pitched screaming]

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.973 size:88% position:44% line:92%
which I realized was me.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:27.674 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:30.577 size:88% position:44%
I was going, "It's okay!
It's just the ceiling!

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:31.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the ceiling!
It's the ceiling!"

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:34.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
But two minutes later, I said,
"Lookit, we were just --"

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:37.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Remember what I sai
about Mr. Goldblum?"

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Everything was covered

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.954 size:84% position:42%
in two inches of dust,
you know, plaster dust.

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:44.591
And then every night after that,
my door would open --

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:46.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Every night?
How many nights did you stay

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.094 line:92%
-I think it was another -- I -

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:50.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I didn't have
any money to go anywhere else.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:52.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had to stay there. But it wa
a good month or something.

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.167 line:92%
The phone would ring. Nothing.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:57.704
The door would squeak open
It was just all really scary

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:00.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm now maybe going to buy in
on ghosts are real.

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:03.276 line:92%
-Well, I never saw him, or -

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:03.977 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But that was just odd.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:07.013 size:78% position:39%
-It seems like that's
100 different signs.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.581 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:09.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, right now,
if he was watching,

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:13.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
he's like, "I didn't
say anything?! I'm a ghost!"

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:16.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thank you so much for
being here. Always a pleasure.

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:17.790 line:92%
Ewan McGregor, everybody.

